		"constraints": {
			"zeros": "off"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Qui a le plus d'argent ?\n\n```monnaie\npièces: {{a}}×2 {{b}}×1 {{c}}×50c {{d}}×20c {{f}}×10c ; {{g}}×2 {{h}}×1 {{k}}×50c {{m}}×20c {{n}}×10c\nlégendes: Léa ; Tom\n```\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- Léa\n- Tom\n- Ils ont autant d'argent.\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "f",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "g",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "eval:200*a+100*b+50*c+20*d+10*f"
				},
				{
					"name": "y",
					"expression": "eval:200*g+100*h+50*k+20*m+10*n"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "{{if:x>y|0|{{if:x<y|1|2}}}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(x - y) <= 50",
				"a + b + c + d + f >= 3",
				"g + h + k + m + n >= 3",
				"mod(x,100) != 0",
				"mod(y,100) != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Léa a ${{eval:floor((x)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(x,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(x,10)}}~\\unit{€}$. Tom a ${{eval:floor((y)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(y,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(y,10)}}~\\unit{€}$.",
					"On compare d'abord les euros, puis les centimes.",
					"{{if:r==0|Léa a le plus d'argent.|{{if:r==1|Tom a le plus d'argent.|Ils ont autant d'argent.}}}}"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Qui a le plus d'argent ?\n\n```monnaie\nbillets: {{if:s==1|{{if:k==5|1×5|}}|}} ; {{if:s==1||{{if:k==5|1×5|}}}}\npièces: {{if:s==1|{{if:k==2|1×2|}}|{{n}}×50c {{m}}×20c {{q}}×10c}} ; {{if:s==1|{{n}}×50c {{m}}×20c {{q}}×10c|{{if:k==2|1×2|}}}}\nlégendes: Léa ; Tom\n```\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- Léa\n- Tom\n- Ils ont autant d'argent.\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2|5"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "0..10"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "0..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "0..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "eval:50*n+20*m+10*q"
				},
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "{{if:s==1|{{eval:100*k}}|{{t}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "y",
					"expression": "{{if:s==1|{{t}}|{{eval:100*k}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "{{if:x>y|0|{{if:x<y|1|2}}}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["abs(t - 100*k) <= 50", "n + m + q >= 5"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Léa a ${{eval:floor((x)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(x,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(x,10)}}~\\unit{€}$. Tom a ${{eval:floor((y)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(y,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(y,10)}}~\\unit{€}$.",
					"{{if:r==0|Léa a le plus d'argent.|{{if:r==1|Tom a le plus d'argent.|Ils ont autant d'argent.}}}}",
					"{{if:t<100*k|Ce n'est pas celui qui a le plus de pièces qui a le plus d'argent : on compte ce qui est écrit dessus.|On ne compte pas les pièces : on compte ce qui est écrit dessus.}}"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Quel est le prix le {{if:k==1|plus cher|moins cher}} ?\n\n```choix\n- ${{a}}~\\unit{€}$\n- ${{c}}$ centimes\n- ${{f}}~\\unit{€}$ et ${{g}}$ centimes\n- ${{eval:floor((v)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(v,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(v,10)}}~\\unit{€}$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "3..45"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "eval:10*b"
				},
				{
					"name": "f",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "1..19"
				},
				{
					"name": "g",
					"expression": "eval:5*h"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "w",
					"expression": "1..19"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "eval:100*u+5*w"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "eval:100*a"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "eval:100*f+g"
				},
				{
					"name": "z",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|{{eval:max(p,c,q,v)}}|{{eval:min(p,c,q,v)}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "{{if:p==z|0|{{if:c==z|1|{{if:q==z|2|3}}}}}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["p != c", "p != q", "p != v", "c != q", "c != v", "q != v"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On écrit les quatre prix de la même façon, avec la virgule :",
					"${{a}}~\\unit{€} = {{eval:floor((p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(p,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ ; ${{c}}$ centimes $= {{eval:floor((c)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(c,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(c,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ ; ${{f}}~\\unit{€}$ et ${{g}}$ centimes $= {{eval:floor((q)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(q,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(q,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ ; ${{eval:floor((v)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(v,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(v,10)}}~\\unit{€}$.",
					"On compare d'abord les euros, puis les centimes. Le {{if:k==1|plus cher|moins cher}} : $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:floor((z)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(z,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(z,10)}}}~\\unit{€}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
